<title>USA: Interpore won't complete sale by year end.</title>
<headline>Interpore won't complete sale by year end.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interpore International, a maker of synthetic bone graft materials, said on Friday it will be unable to complete the sale of its dental business to Friatec AG by December 31, as anticipated.</p>
<p>Both companies, however, remain interested in completing the deal and discussions are continuing, Interpore said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Friatec has informed us that it will be unable to complete the transaction by year end 1996,&quot; said David Mercer, chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
